the Past — Exile target card from a graveyard. You gain 2 life.\n• Obliterate the Transwarp Network — Destroy target artifact or enchantment with mana value 3 or less.",["manaCost"]="{G}",["power"]="",["toughness"]="",["loyalty"]="",["rarity"]="uncommon",["related"]={}},["722eeb21-be3c-4ae6-abd2-c3281d53c035"]={["oracleId"]="6cb1c3fb-033a-4de5-ad07-69d9ad0ca5ae",["oracle"]="Choose one —\n• Plain, Simple Garak — Exile target card from a graveyard. Draw a card.\n• Of the Obsidian Order — Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.",["manaCost"]="{B}",["power"]="",["toughness"]="",["loyalty"]="",["rarity"]="uncommon",["related"]={}},["89e3ec23-e4dc-4d58-aeda-9f73ed4504a5"]={["oracleId"]="cd24de4f-ce88-4fbb-9e8d-93ea7c260b4c",["oracle"]="Choose one —\n• Power to Engines — Surveil 2, then draw a card.\n• Power to Life Support — Exile target creature you control. Return that card to the battlefield under its owner's control at the beginning of the next end step.",["manaCost"]="{1}{U}",["power"]="",["toughness"]="",["loyalty"]="",["rarity"]="uncommon",["related"]={}},["1ddcb7a0-d5ab-44e3-8579-657c2b6c0222"]={["oracleId"]="a9a84fbb-0972-4a3d-bdae-a3b01219b35d",["oracle"]="Islandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)\nWhenever Thada Adel deals combat damage to a player, search that player's library for an artifact card and exile it. Then that player shuffles. Until end of turn, you may play that card.",["manaCost"]="{1}{U}{U}",["power"]="2",["toughness"]="2",["loyalty"]="",["rarity"]="mythic",["related"]={}},["9d356fdd-3bbc-418a-8b6d-5410bf7a1138"]={["oracleId"]="66fc3c1e-acea-46eb-8af8-b0740f006add",["oracle"]="{T}: Add one mana of any color.\nBattlefront — {T}: Choose a color. Add an amount of mana of that color equal to the number of opponents you attacked this turn.",["manaCost"]="{2}{R}",["power"]="",["toughness"]="",["loyalty"]="",["rarity"]="rare",["related"]={}},["371cc003-0c2c-47a5-83a4-bca6581a0974"]=