ut it onto the battlefield under your control with a +1/+1 counter. It's a Borg artifact creature and loses all other creature types.)",["manaCost"]="{4}{W}{U}{B}",["power"]="4",["toughness"]="4",["loyalty"]="",["rarity"]="mythic",["related"]={}},["ec6a1967-78fc-4ef4-9816-6d9a9dde61fb"]={["oracleId"]="f77ea393-4142-4c06-8bb3-589ca74a7338",["oracle"]="Vigilance, ward {2}\nAt the beginning of each end step, if you faced a dilemma this turn, target opponent exiles cards from the top of their library until they exile a nonland card. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost. (You face a dilemma as you choose one or more modes for a spell or ability.)",["manaCost"]="{5}{U}",["power"]="5",["toughness"]="6",["loyalty"]="",["rarity"]="rare",["related"]={}},["492df5d5-04a2-49d2-a639-61b19f4419df"]={["oracleId"]="f77ea393-4142-4c06-8bb3-589ca74a7338",["oracle"]="Vigilance, ward {2}\nAt the beginning of each end step, if you faced a dilemma this turn, target opponent exiles cards from the top of their library until they exile a nonland card. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost. (You face a dilemma as you choose one or more modes for a spell or ability.)",["manaCost"]="{5}{U}",["power"]="5",["toughness"]="6",["loyalty"]="",["rarity"]="rare",["related"]={}},["aac6f64d-d39a-4994-bc70-6b477b2640f8"]={["oracleId"]="47c9ef8c-7ba7-4702-bd8c-5fedc59c8166",["oracle"]="(As this Saga enters and after your draw step, add a lore counter. Sacrifice after III.)\nI — All artifacts and creatures phase out. Create a 0/1 white Human creature token with \"Permanents can't phase in.\" (Treat phased-out permanents and anything attached to them as though they don't exist.)\nII — You draw two cards and each player loses 2 life.\nIII — Sacrifice a creature token. If you do, you gain 5 life.",["manaCost"]="{3}{W}{B}",["power"]="",["toughness"]="",["loyalty"]="",["rarity"]="rare",["related"]={{["object"]="related_card",["id"]="25b0644d-4934-4495-9b6e-c31d1d10c298",["component"]